## Summary

**Files changed:** `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`

**Behavior added:** Added `-h` / `--no-filename` option that forces filename prefixes off, regardless of default rules.

**Last-one-wins resolution:** The `force_filename` variable tracks the state: -1 (unset), 0 (off via -h/--no-filename), 1 (on via -H/--with-filename). Later options override earlier ones. Combined short options like `-Hh` or `-hH` are processed left-to-right within the same argument.

